{"sha": "9977d5fb7d0d8bb26af0eda66e6993e94922e43aa21c80e92f6446f809f3da2a", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "偶解在阱内为 $A\\cos kx$，阱外为 $B\\eu^{-\\kappa|x|}$；", "由 $\\varphi'/\\varphi$ 在 $x = a$ 处的连续性，得 $-k\\tan ka = -\\kappa$。", "奇解同理，改用 $\\sin$。圆即 $k$ 与", "$\\kappa$ 的定义。$\\xi\\tan\\xi$ 的各分支，始于 $\\xi = n\\pi$ 者，与", "$-\\xi\\cot\\xi$ 的各分支，始于 $(n + \\tfrac12)\\pi$ 者，与圆恰交一次，若", "其起点在圆内，由此得上述计数。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=5.2, ymin=0, ymax=5.2,", "    xlabel={$\\xi = ka$}, ylabel={$\\eta = \\kappa a$}, xtick={1.571,3.142,4.712}, xticklabels={$\\pi/2$,$\\pi$,$3\\pi/2$}, ytick=\\empty, clip=true,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.98,0.98)}, anchor=north east, draw=none, fill=white}]", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1.5, samples=80] {x*tan(deg(x))};", "    \\addlegendentry{$\\xi\\tan\\xi$（偶）}", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=1.6:3.1, samples=80] {-x/tan(deg(x))};", "    \\addlegendentry{$-\\xi\\cot\\xi$（奇）}", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=3.2:4.65, samples=80] {x*tan(deg(x))};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=4.75:5.2, samples=40] {-x/tan(deg(x))};", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:4, samples=100] {sqrt(16-x*x)};", "    \\addlegendentry{$\\xi^2 + \\eta^2 = R^2$}", "    \\addplot[gray, dashed, domain=0:1.2, samples=40] {sqrt(1.44-x*x)};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 有限深阱的图解：束缚态为", "半径 $R = a\\sqrt{2mV_0}/\\hbar$ 的圆与", "分支 $\\xi\\tan\\xi$（偶态）、$-\\xi\\cot\\xi$（奇态）的交点。", "此处 $R = 4$，故有三个束缚态；虚线小圆（$R = 1.2$）仍与第一支相交，", "即阱总至少束缚一个态。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[纳米阱中的电子]\\label{ex:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:finite}", "阱深 $V_0 = \\qty{1}{eV}$，宽 $2a = \\qty{1}{nm}$：$R = a\\sqrt{2mV_0}/\\hbar = 0.5 \\times", "10^{-9} \\times 5.1 \\times 10^9 = 2.6$，故共有 $1 + \\lfloor 2R/\\pi\\rfloor = 2$ 个", "束缚态；基态能量在 \\qty{0.26}{eV} 附近，而无限深阱的基态能量为", "\\qty{0.38}{eV}，粒子渗入阱壁约 \\qty{0.2}{nm}", "（$1/\\kappa = \\hbar/\\sqrt{2m(V_0 - E)}$）。此类阱以", "数纳米厚的半导体薄层生长而成，是二极管激光器的核心，", "见\\cref{ch:b2:laser}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{势阶与势垒：隧道效应}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[势阶]\\label{prop:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:step}", "能量为 $E$ 的粒子自 $x < 0$ 一侧射向台阶 $V = V_0$，", "台阶位于 $x > 0$ 区域：", "\\begin{itemize}", "\\item $E > V_0$：左侧 $\\varphi = \\eu^{\\iu k_1x} + r\\eu^{-\\iu k_1x}$，右侧为 $t\\eu^{\\iu", "      k_2x}$，其中 $k_{1,2} = \\sqrt{2m(E - V_{0,\\text{左/右}})}/", "      \\hbar$；由 $\\varphi$ 与 $\\varphi'$ 的连续性得 $r = (k_1 - k_2)/(k_1", "      + k_2)$，反射概率（电流之比）为 $R = r^2$，", "      $T = 1 - R = 4k_1k_2/(k_1 + k_2)^2$ --- 粒子\\emph{可被能量足以攀越的", "      台阶反射}，正如弦上的波因阻抗变化而反射", "      （见\\cref{ch:b2:wave-interfaces}）；", "\\item $E < V_0$：右侧 $\\varphi = t\\eu^{-\\kappa x}$，$\\kappa = \\sqrt{2m(V_0", "      - E)}/\\hbar$ --- 一个\\emph{倏逝波}\\index{倏逝波", "      （量子）}；$|r| = 1$（全反射，伴有相移），", "      无电流流入台阶，但粒子在该处被发现的", "      概率在 $1/\\kappa$ 范围内衰减。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在 $x = 0$ 处写出连续性方程并求解；计算电流时", "取 $j = (|A|^2 - |B|^2)\\hbar k/m$（见\\cref{ch:b2:schrodinger-wave-functions}）。", "当 $E < V_0$ 时，$r = (k - \\iu\\kappa)/(k + \\iu\\kappa)$，模为 1。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[穿过势垒的隧道效应]\\label{thm:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:tunnel}", "能量为 $E < V_0$ 的粒子遇到一个矩形势垒，其高度为", "$V_0$、宽度为 $a$，其透射概率为", "\\[", "T = \\Big[1 + \\frac{V_0^2\\sinh^2(\\kappa a)}{4E(V_0 - E)}\\Big]^{-1}", "\\ \\approx\\ 16\\,\\frac{E}{V_0}\\Big(1 - \\frac{E}{V_0}\\Big)\\eu^{-2\\kappa a}", "\\quad (\\kappa a \\gg 1), \\qquad", "\\kappa = \\frac{\\sqrt{2m(V_0 - E)}}{\\hbar} .", "\\]", "这就是\\emph{隧道效应}\\index{隧道效应}：经典上", "不可能，量子力学下却指数级地小 --- 并且", "对宽度 $a$、高度 $V_0 - E$ 与", "质量 $m$ 呈指数级敏感。对于比顶部低 \\qty{1}{eV} 的电子，$\\kappa = \\qty{5.1}{nm^{-1}}$：", "$T \\sim 10^{-2}$（$a = \\qty{0.5}{nm}$），$10^{-4}$ 对应 \\qty{1}{nm}，$10^{-9}$ 对应", "\\qty{2}{nm}；对于质子，$\\kappa$ 是前者的 $43$ 倍，在这些宽度下", "几乎无法穿过。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\varphi = \\eu^{\\iu kx} + r\\eu^{-\\iu kx}$（$x < 0$）；势垒内为 $A\\eu^{\\kappa x} + B\\eu^{-\\kappa x}$，", "$t\\eu^{\\iu kx}$（$x > a$）；四个连续性条件（$\\varphi$ 与", "$\\varphi'$ 在 $0$、$a$ 处）共四个未知数；消去 $A$、$B$、$r$，", "得 $1/|t|^2 = 1 + (k^2 + \\kappa^2)^2\\sinh^2(\\kappa a)/4k^2\\kappa^2$，即为上式，其中", "$k^2 = 2mE/\\hbar^2$，$\\kappa^2 = 2m(V_0 - E)/\\hbar^2$。当", "$\\kappa a \\gg 1$ 时，$\\sinh\\kappa a \\approx \\eu^{\\kappa a}/2$。对形状任意的", "势垒，指数项变为 $2\\int\\kappa(x)\\dd x$，积分沿", "整个禁区进行，即伽莫夫因子，在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9, >=stealth]", "  \\fill[gray!15] (3,0) rectangle (4.2,2.6);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (3,0) -- (3,2.6) -- (4.2,2.6) -- (4.2,0) -- (7.5,0);", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (0,1.2) -- (7.5,1.2) node[right, font=\\scriptsize] {$E$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (3.6,2.85) {$V_0$};", "  \\draw[<->, thin] (3,-0.3) -- (4.2,-0.3) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$a$};", "  % wave: incident+reflected (left), evanescent (inside), transmitted (right)", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=0:3, samples=120] plot (\\x,{1.2+0.5*cos(deg(6*\\x))});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=3:4.2, samples=40] plot (\\x,{1.2+0.5*exp(-1.6*(\\x-3))});", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, domain=4.2:7.5, samples=120] plot (\\x,{1.2+0.073*cos(deg(6*(\\x-4.2)))});", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (1.5,2.1) {$\\eu^{\\iu kx} + r\\eu^{-\\iu kx}$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (3.6,1.95) {$\\eu^{-\\kappa x}$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (6.0,1.75) {$t\\eu^{\\iu kx}$, $|t|^2 \\approx 16\\frac{E}{V_0}(1 - \\frac{E}{V_0})\\eu^{-2\\kappa a}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}